              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oltung'ani opaashari inkoitoi enyena, naa keiputakini ninye ilng'anayio loo nkoitoi enyena, ore oltung'ani supat naa keiputakini ninye ilng'anayio loo nkiasin enyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
